    /// Aggregates ScopeMap objects. Keys represent bins, 
    /// values represent bin counts. The aggregator takes the set union of the keys, 
    /// and for the keys in the intersection it adds up the values.
    /// 
    /// The complicated class name gets parsed by Scope to extract 
